# Outbound destinations the first-minute default deny keeps open
# (design 03, section 6.1), beyond the scored services in `services`.
# Format: `address proto port`, one per line; address is an address or CIDR,
# proto is tcp or udp, port is a number or `any`. Include DNS resolvers,
# NTP servers, the SIEM (the forwarder port and the TCP syslog fallback,
# design 14), the package mirror or proxy, and anything a scored service
# connects out to. Placeholder (documentation) ranges only.

